#: ../../entities/chongming-park.rst:1
msgid "Zhangjiang Chongming Park"
msgstr "张江高新区崇明园"

#: ../../entities/chongming-park.rst:4
msgid "张江高新区崇明园"
msgstr "张江高新区崇明园"

#: ../../entities/chongming-park.rst:6
msgid "Technology park | Chongming | Research checked 2026-11-04"
msgstr "科技园区｜崇明区｜研究核对日期 2026-11-04"

#: ../../entities/chongming-park.rst:8
msgid ""
"The 2025-2026 reform plan sets a framework for ecological innovation. We "
"use the district authority for matching smart agriculture, ecological "
"sensing and marine technology projects to a concrete carrier."
msgstr "2025至2026年改革方案构建生态创新框架。智慧农业、生态传感及海洋科技项目可通过区级主管部门对接具体载体。"

#: ../../entities/chongming-park.rst:10
msgid ""
"`Evidence S025 "
"<https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/nw12344/20250512/98a1bb8a73c54cb785296ad1835845e1.html>`_. "
"崇明区人民政府关于印发《张江高新区崇明园改革创新发展行动方案（2025-2026年）》的通知."
msgstr "`证据 S025 <https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/nw12344/20250512/98a1bb8a73c54cb785296ad1835845e1.html>`_. 崇明区人民政府关于印发《张江高新区崇明园改革创新发展行动方案（2025-2026年）》的通知."

#: ../../entities/chongming-park.rst:12
msgid "Status and support"
msgstr "状态与支持"

#: ../../entities/chongming-park.rst:15
msgid "Published entity; intake to confirm"
msgstr "机构有来源，招募待确认"

#: ../../entities/chongming-park.rst:17
msgid ""
"No standard cash award, fee waiver or equity percentage is verified for "
"this entry. Request the current written offer."
msgstr "本条未核实统一现金资助、免费权益或股权比例，请索取现行书面方案。"

#: ../../entities/chongming-park.rst:19
msgid "Contact and location"
msgstr "联系与位置"

#: ../../entities/chongming-park.rst:22
msgid ""
"`Official evidence and authority route "
"<https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/nw12344/20250512/98a1bb8a73c54cb785296ad1835845e1.html>`_"
msgstr "`官方来源与主管部门入口 <https://www.shanghai.gov.cn/nw12344/20250512/98a1bb8a73c54cb785296ad1835845e1.html>`_"

#: ../../entities/chongming-park.rst:24
msgid ""
"A direct program phone or email is not verified here. Use the official "
"route and request the responsible team; no contact has been invented."
msgstr "本版未核实项目直线电话或邮箱。请通过官方渠道索取负责团队，本图谱不编造联系人。"

#: ../../entities/chongming-park.rst:26
msgid ""
"Map position uses a district or campus anchor; it is not a verified "
"office location."
msgstr "地图位置使用区级或校区锚点，并非核实后的办公室位置。"

#: ../../entities/chongming-park.rst:28
msgid "Application workflow"
msgstr "申请流程"

#: ../../entities/chongming-park.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../entities/chongming-park.rst:33
msgid "Send a project brief and request the current admission checklist."
msgstr "发送项目简介，索取现行入驻清单。"

#: ../../entities/chongming-park.rst:35
msgid ""
"Complete the operator's eligibility and technical or commercial review."
msgstr "完成运营方资格及技术或商业评审。"

#: ../../entities/chongming-park.rst:37
msgid ""
"Confirm rent, service fees, IP, compute pricing and any equity rights in "
"writing."
msgstr "书面确认租金、服务费、知识产权、算力价格及任何股权权利。"

#: ../../entities/chongming-park.rst:39
msgid ""
"Sign the agreed admission documents and record milestones and support "
"owners."
msgstr "签署入驻文件，记录里程碑与服务负责人。"

